  <title>Bank statements</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Bank statements</gui></guiseq> lists a
  bank account's transactions, and whether and when each was reconciled in
  <link xref="bank_statement"/>.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the bank account.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose a reconcile date in <gui>Filter by reconcile date</gui>
    to see one statement's transactions.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose how to list them: <gui>Single</gui> lines,
    <gui>Grouped</gui> by the date they were reconciled, or <gui>Linked</gui>,
    each with the other lines of its transaction beneath it.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>A bar above the list says how many rows were loaded and how long it took.
  The window menu has <gui>Expand all</gui>, <gui>Collapse all</gui> and
  <gui>Report hub</gui> (see <link xref="report_hub"/>).</p>

  <p>Check <gui>Edit mode</gui> in the window menu, which asks for the
  administrator password, to right click a line and <link
  xref="edit_gl_entry">Edit GL entry</link>.</p>

</page>
